{"2997840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animalkind", "steam_appid": 2997840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/7219446b83fad4a7cd90257e20f11e43.avif?t=1782941888\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras_big/7219446b83fad4a7cd90257e20f11e43.avif?t=1782941888 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ideal village in the relaxing, cozy open world of Animalkind. Explore the wilderness and meet new characters who might join your town. Use the power of an ancient mech to craft and build. Invite friends to join you and build together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <strong>Play as an Animal</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/887044a86b270d1b77445ac9d3b79eef.poster.avif?t=1782941888\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/887044a86b270d1b77445ac9d3b79eef.webm?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/887044a86b270d1b77445ac9d3b79eef.mp4?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an adorable (or mischievous) animal! Choose from exciting options like a cuddly corgi, a typical-orange-cat-energy tabby, and a North American trash panda (a.k.a common raccoon) - each with unique and aww-some animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a Mech</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/659c8b7f880f0251109bb3cd68186c76.poster.avif?t=1782941888\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/659c8b7f880f0251109bb3cd68186c76.webm?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/659c8b7f880f0251109bb3cd68186c76.mp4?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an ancient mech and use your tiny lil’ paws to control it! Make use of its industrial-grade opposable thumbs and an upgradeable chassis to build, gather resources and traverse the expansive world of Animalkind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Village</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/2703225649f118c172d6139697d8aa59.poster.avif?t=1782941888\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/2703225649f118c172d6139697d8aa59.webm?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/2703225649f118c172d6139697d8aa59.mp4?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish a quaint and bustling town! Gather a community of friendly animals by building houses, laying out paths, and transforming the terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Wilderness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/2c5fc6cf329394720f765c43fb44bfc2.poster.avif?t=1782941888\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/2c5fc6cf329394720f765c43fb44bfc2.webm?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/2c5fc6cf329394720f765c43fb44bfc2.mp4?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the wilderness, a vast and ever-evolving set of destinations. Travel to dynamic wilderness areas with unique biomes, recruitable characters, valuable resources and a few surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <strong>Play Solo or Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/bab296ce2aa546a403b550fd278fcf39.poster.avif?t=1782941888\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/bab296ce2aa546a403b550fd278fcf39.webm?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/bab296ce2aa546a403b550fd278fcf39.mp4?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solo journey or cozy co-op with your friends! Invite up to 3 friends to be a part of your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Customize your Character and your Mech</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/8930c2aa9e7a18368b96ea0285292248.poster.avif?t=1782941888\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/8930c2aa9e7a18368b96ea0285292248.webm?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/8930c2aa9e7a18368b96ea0285292248.mp4?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feelin’ expressive? Customize your character and mech! Swap out cosmetics, slap on stickers and pilot your mech in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn more about the world of Animalkind</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/71eb338699ee9f18246b19f36f279be0.poster.avif?t=1782941888\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/71eb338699ee9f18246b19f36f279be0.webm?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/71eb338699ee9f18246b19f36f279be0.mp4?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the quirky characters and cozy vibes lies a mysterious world. Explore and uncover hints at what transpired before your character joined the world of Animalkind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Characters:</strong> Enjoy your time in the game as the cute animal of your choice, each complete with unique and aww-dorable animations. Currently the game has corgi, cat, and raccoon options but you can look forward to this expanding in the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-operative Gameplay:</strong> Play collaboratively with friends on your home island, building a town together and enjoying the activities of Animalkind. You can also venture into the Wilderness and  work together to explore the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building, Crafting, and More:</strong> Use the power of the ancient mech and its technology to build, craft, cook, and cultivate. Animalkind provides players with powerful and flexible tools to adapt their islands as they see fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity and Customization:</strong> Make your village aww-mazing with a variety of furniture and other decorations. Customize your animal character with a favorite coat style and your mech with an eye-catching paint job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convenient Multiplayer:</strong> Playing together with friends is simple and convenient in Animalkind.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ideal village in the relaxing, cozy open world of Animalkind. Explore the wilderness and meet new characters who might join your town. Use the power of an ancient mech to craft and build. Invite friends to join you and build together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <strong>Play as an Animal</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/887044a86b270d1b77445ac9d3b79eef.poster.avif?t=1782941888\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/887044a86b270d1b77445ac9d3b79eef.webm?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997840/extras/887044a86b270d1b77445ac9d3b79eef.mp4?t=1782941888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p clas