/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Characters:</strong> Enjoy your time in the game as the cute animal of your choice, each complete with unique and aww-dorable animations. Currently the game has corgi, cat, and raccoon options but you can look forward to this expanding in the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-operative Gameplay:</strong> Play collaboratively with friends on your home island, building a town together and enjoying the activities of Animalkind. You can also venture into the Wilderness and  work together to explore the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building, Crafting, and More:</strong> Use the power of the ancient mech and its technology to build, craft, cook, and cultivate. Animalkind provides players with powerful and flexible tools to adapt their islands as they see fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity and Customization:</strong> Make your village aww-mazing with a variety of furniture and other decorations. Customize your animal character with a favorite coat style and your mech with an eye-catching paint job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convenient Multiplayer:</strong> Playing together with friends is simple and convenient in Animalkind.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Forage, frolic and zoomie as an intelligent, aww-dorable animal who discovers an ancient mech. Pilot the mech and use a suite of powerful tools to gather resources, shape the land, and build your ideal town alongside a growing cast of characters—solo or with up to three friends.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“If you're looking to hide away from reality and get a dose of serotonin when it's very needed, this new cozy game is exactly what you're looking for.”<br>GameSpot<br><br>“Mechs are cool. Cute little fluffy animals a